# Web3Forms access key for the contact form (components/contact/). Get one free at https://web3forms.com
# (it's tied to the inbox the messages go to). Copy this file to .env.local and fill it in, then restart `npm run dev`.
# It's baked in when the site is built, so after changing it rebuild (`next build`), and when you deploy, add the same
# variable in your host's environment variables (.env.local is never uploaded) and redeploy.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
